{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 7, :comments ["<b>And you shall sanctify yourselves.</b> By separation from forbidden sexual relations." "<b>And you shall be holy.</b> So that your lineage will be fit for the Shekhinah to dwell upon, as they said, of blessed memory (Qiddushin 70b): the Shekhinah dwells only upon families of verified lineage in Israel." "<b>For I am YHWH your Elohim.</b> As I said to Abraham: לִהְיוֹת לְךָ לֵאלֹהִים וּלְזַרְעֲךָ אַחֲרֶיךָ — 'to be a Elohim to you and to your seed after you' (Genesis 17:7) — to the seed traced after you, as they expounded, of blessed memory (Numbers Rabbah 12:4)."], :book :leviticus, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 20, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:37:04.638761485Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}